        "prompt": "$y=|x-4|$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=\\begin{cases}x-4,&x\\geq4,\\\\-x+4,&x<4.\\end{cases}$",
          "worked": "The argument $x-4$ is non-negative for $x\\geq4$ and negative for $x<4$. Therefore\n$$y=\\begin{cases}x-4,&x\\geq4,\\\\-(x-4)=-x+4,&x<4.\\end{cases}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p4-q12-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$y=|x+3|$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=\\begin{cases}x+3,&x\\geq-3,\\\\-x-3,&x<-3.\\end{cases}$",
          "worked": "The argument $x+3$ is non-negative for $x\\geq-3$ and negative for $x<-3$. Therefore\n$$y=\\begin{cases}x+3,&x\\geq-3,\\\\-(x+3)=-x-3,&x<-3.\\end{cases}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p4-q12-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$y=|2x-3|$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=\\begin{cases}2x-3,&x\\geq\\frac32,\\\\-2x+3,&x<\\frac32.\\end{cases}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x-3&\\geq0\\\\2x&\\geq3\\\\x&\\geq\\frac32.\\end{align*}$$\nThus\n$$y=\\begin{cases}2x-3,&x\\geq\\frac32,\\\\-(2x-3)=-2x+3,&x<\\frac32.\\end{cases}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
      }
